om  it's changed the way we have to do  things at home not just at work  now if the bigger hospitals reach  capacity one nurse told me they'd turn  the entire medical floor into a coveted  ward  that means they'd have to put other  patients into surgical rooms  and when they fill up the hallways gail  they hope it doesn't come to that  well we all hope that thank you very  much carter
 

